{"speciesId":430,"names":{"fr":"Corboss","es":"Honchkrow","en":"Honchkrow","ja":"ドンカラス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Becoming active at night, it is known to swarm with numerous MURKROW in tow."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It makes its MURKROW cronies bring it food. It idles its time away, grooming itself in its nest."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"If one utters a deep cry, many MURKROW gather quickly. For this, it is called “Summoner of Night.”"},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is merciless by nature. It is said that it never forgives the mistakes of its MURKROW followers."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It is merciless by nature. It is said that it never forgives the mistakes of its MURKROW followers."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son cri profond peut invoquer une meute de Cornèbre. On l’appelle “le crieur de mauvais augure”."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"If one utters a deep cry, many Murkrow gather quickly. For this, it is called “Summoner of Night.”"},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son cri profond peut invoquer une meute de Cornèbre. On l’appelle “le crieur de mauvais augure”."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"If one utters a deep cry, many Murkrow gather quickly. For this, it is called “Summoner of Night.”"},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"If one utters a deep cry, many Murkrow gather quickly. For this, it is called “Summoner of Night.”"},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"If one utters a deep cry, many Murkrow gather quickly. For this, it is called “Summoner of Night.”"},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son cri profond peut invoquer une meute de Cornèbre. On l’appelle « le crieur de mauvais augure »."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Si uno lanza un grito profundo, los demás acuden. Por eso se le llama también Invocador de la Noche."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"If one utters a deep cry, many Murkrow gather quickly. For this, it is called “Summoner of Night.”"},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ドンカラスが 低い声で 鳴くと すぐさま ヤミカラスが 集まるため 夜を招くもの とも 言われる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ce Pokémon nocturne évolue en grandes volées escortées par des Cornèbre."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Está activo por la noche y pulula arrastrando a numerosos Murkrow."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Becoming active at night, it is known to swarm with numerous Murkrow in tow."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"夜になると 活動を はじめる。 たくさんの ヤミカラスを 引き連れ 群れを 作ることで 知られる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Son cri profond peut invoquer une meute de Cornèbre. On l’appelle « le crieur de mauvais augure »."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Si uno lanza un grito profundo, los demás acuden. Por eso se le llama también Invocador de la Noche."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"If one utters a deep cry, many Murkrow gather quickly. For this, it is called “Summoner of Night.”"},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"ドンカラスが 低い声で 鳴くと すぐさま ヤミカラスが 集まるため 夜を招くもの とも 言われる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ce Pokémon nocturne évolue en grandes volées escortées par des Cornèbre."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Está activo por la noche y pulula arrastrando a numerosos Murkrow."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Becoming active at night, it is known to swarm with numerous Murkrow in tow."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"夜になると 活動を はじめる。 たくさんの ヤミカラスを 引き連れ 群れを 作ることで 知られる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Un seul des puissants croassements de ce Pokémon nocturne lui permet de rassembler une centaine de Cornèbre, ses sous-fifres."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Es un Pokémon nocturno. Con un solo grito puede hacer que acudan más de cien de sus leales Murkrow."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"A single cry from this nocturnal Pokémon, and more than a hundred of its Murkrow cronies will assemble."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"夜行性。 一声 鳴けば １００匹を 超える 子分の ヤミカラスが 集結する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Si l’un de ses sous-fifres Cornèbre a le malheur de le décevoir ou d’échouer dans sa mission, le Corboss le pourchassera sans le moindre répit."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Si alguno de sus leales Murkrow fracasa en conseguirle una presa o se la guarda para sí, lo perseguirá sin descanso para castigarle."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"If its Murkrow cronies fail to catch food for it, or if it feels they have betrayed it, it will hunt them down wherever they are and punish them."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"獲物を 捕るのを 失敗したり 裏切った 子分の ヤミカラスを どこまでも 追い詰め 処分する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il ne pardonne jamais la trahison ou la défaite d’un subordonné. Le bien-être de l’ensemble de la volée en dépend."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"No perdona el más mínimo error ni la traición de sus subordinados. Este estricto código es para preservar la integridad de su bandada."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It will absolutely not forgive failure from or betrayal by its goons. It has no choice in this if it wants to maintain the order of the flock."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"失敗したり 裏切った 子分は 絶対に 許さない。 群れの 秩序を 守るため やむないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ses sous-fifres font le sale boulot pour lui. Il n’intervient en combat que pour donner le coup de grâce à son ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Delega el combate en sus leales súbditos y solo se involucra cuando llega la hora de asestarle el golpe de gracia al enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its goons take care of most of the fighting for it. The only time it dirties its own hands is in delivering a final blow to finish off an opponent."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"敵と 戦うのは ほぼ 子分。 自分の 手を 汚すのは 相手に 最後の 止めを 刺すときだけ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"One cry from this Pokémon, and a murder of Murkrow come flying. At such times, one would think the curtain of night had fallen, plunging the world into jet-black darkness."}],"varieties":[{"id":430,"moves":[{"name":"gust","learns":[[23,"level-up",1],[24,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"wing-attack","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"peck","learns":[[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"psychic","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"night-shade","learns":[[23,"level-up",1],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"ma